      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/c4cdca/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-11-18T15:33:55.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I did a little searching around, but didn't see any other topics so please forgive me if I missed something. I was bored one day so I created an exhaustive database of all the digital cards within the SotM app. The database records the instance of every character's appearance (issue wise) and what card(s) that information is drawn from. While doing this, I noticed a possible discrepancy with Fanatic. Her bio states that her first appearance is in Mystery Comics #368, but Scholar's card \"Expect the Worst\" contains an&nbsp;<em>identified</em> quote from Fanatic in Mystery Comics #281. How can this be? Or was this an oversight by the design team? What are your thoughts?</p><p>Just random musings by a curious fan of the game (and story).</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:48:23.427Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
