      "raw": "<p>I did a little searching around, but didn&#39;t see any other topics so please forgive me if I missed something. I was bored one day so I created an exhaustive database of all the digital cards within the SotM app. The database records the instance of every character&#39;s appearance (issue wise) and what card(s) that information is drawn from. While doing this, I noticed a possible discrepancy with Fanatic. Her bio states that her first appearance is in Mystery Comics #368, but Scholar&#39;s card &quot;Expect the Worst&quot; contains an&nbsp;<em>identified</em> quote from Fanatic in Mystery Comics #281. How can this be? Or was this an oversight by the design team? What are your thoughts?</p><p>Just random musings by a curious fan of the game (and story).</p>",
