      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Yes. &nbsp;I think Apostate has a similar issue with first appearance if you look at his and Fanatic's cards. &nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Visionary is also quoted in the comic directly before her first apperance.</p>\n<p>It seems very very odd though that Fanatic is quoted in a comic nearly 100 issues before she first appeares. I'll have to take a look at the cards again because I dont remember this particular one coming up before.</p>",
