 Fanatic Comics detail a fight with the Dreamer, and I think storywise Fanatic holes herself up in that bell tower after losing to Apostate, emerges as Redeemer Fanatic (Fanatic #30), and then beats Apostate. That&#39;d result in a nice thematic ending because the final issue of Absolution (#19) is mentioned by Wrathful Retribution.&nbsp;</p><p>tldr: The chronology of Sentinels is tough to line up across all the comics.</p><p>Edit: Sorry about the poor formatting. My data table didn&#39;t transition well from Excel to post.</p>",
