      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>It is possible that her quote in Mystery Comics #281, while attributed on the card&nbsp;as who we know today as Fanatic, was said by Helena as a kid before her accident and before she actually became Fanatic. This would keep intact a &quot;first apperance&quot; 87 entire issues later.</p><p>Along the same lines, there is speculation out there that Apostate indeed has quotes attributed to him before he was actually known as Apostate. I think, in the comic world, he was an unknown mysterious player for a number of issues before he was formally introduced as Apostate. Even though quotes on cards attribute text to Apostate before his first apperance.</p>",
